* {{audio|Fr-laisser.ogg|audio|lang=fr}}
* {{IPA|/lɛse/|lang=fr}}

===Verb===
{{fr-verb}}

# {{label|fr|transitive}} to [[leave]], to [[leave]] behind
#: '''''Laissez''' le pistolet sur la table''
#:: ''Leave the gun on the table''
# {{label|fr|transitive}} to [[forget]], to [[leave]] alone
# {{label|fr|transitive}} to [[leave]] with, to [[give]]
# {{label|fr|transitive}} to [[let]], to [[allow]]
# {{label|fr|reflexive|se laisser}} to [[allow]] oneself, to [[let]] oneself

